{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08701","headline":"秋夜板桥浦泛月独酌怀谢朓 · 李白","name":"秋夜板桥浦泛月独酌怀谢朓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上何所有，迢迢白玉绳。\n斜低建章阙，耿耿对金陵。\n汉水旧如练，霜江夜清澄。\n长川泻落月，洲渚晓寒凝。\n独酌板桥浦，古人谁可徵。\n玄晖难再得，洒酒气填膺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}